"<strong>Q6.</strong> A mystery atom at {#} m/s (M = {#} u) makes nine evenly spaced spots {#} mm apart at {#} T/m with a {#} cm drift. Find J, μ_z of each spot and the g factor. Which atom and ground level fit?",
